{"3533390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Firefighters Code Red", "steam_appid": 3533390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/032cfce42bd9db91f87d59b4ff30af02.poster.avif?t=1784700641\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/032cfce42bd9db91f87d59b4ff30af02.webm?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/032cfce42bd9db91f87d59b4ff30af02.mp4?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Firefighters Code Red</strong>, the dev team draws on their experience from Firefighting Simulator – The Squad to send you to over 30 different locations across North America. Suit up and head exactly where everyone else is fleeing from: straight into the fire, through blazing buildings, thick smoke, and collapsing structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/60c1e9ca6a27d140fcc06efbb70a5a72.poster.avif?t=1784700641\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/60c1e9ca6a27d140fcc06efbb70a5a72.webm?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/60c1e9ca6a27d140fcc06efbb70a5a72.mp4?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/fb306dba928832a1367fe123bd5129ad.poster.avif?t=1784700641\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/fb306dba928832a1367fe123bd5129ad.webm?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/fb306dba928832a1367fe123bd5129ad.mp4?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game simulates fire with the same intensity it has in real life: it eats through rooms, spreads dynamically, and strikes back. Backdrafts detonate in an instant, grease fires punish the wrong extinguishing agent without mercy, and smoke thickens into a life-threatening zone of zero visibility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's electronics, chemicals, or uncontrolled chain reactions - every fire plays by its own rules. In Firefighters Code Red, fire spreads unpredictably, burns more fiercely both indoors and outdoors, and leaves visible destruction behind. And the danger doesn't stop at your front door: flames can spread to smaller wooded areas too, throwing new challenges your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/92ee9d5d745c4b27402255877b375b57.poster.avif?t=1784700641\" width=780 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/92ee9d5d745c4b27402255877b375b57.webm?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/92ee9d5d745c4b27402255877b375b57.mp4?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/f16358594cf24d9c1f675c7434690da7.poster.avif?t=1784700641\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/f16358594cf24d9c1f675c7434690da7.webm?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/f16358594cf24d9c1f675c7434690da7.mp4?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge alone or call in your squad: in  cross-platform co-op multiplayer, you plan your mission together, split up the tasks, and work as a coordinated team. Can you count on each other when every second matters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel of authentic fire trucks and use a wide range of realistic equipment. Every tool has its moment – every call demands the right decision at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random elements keep every call unpredictable. Whether the number and location of victims change, fires break out in new places, or escape routes that were open suddenly get blocked: what you learned on your last call can help you - but you should never count on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/d4736347520eebbf425519a6c76f5389.poster.avif?t=1784700641\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/d4736347520eebbf425519a6c76f5389.webm?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/d4736347520eebbf425519a6c76f5389.mp4?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer and  cross-platform co-op multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 different mission locations in a North American setting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic missions with random elements: number &amp; location of victims, number &amp; location of fires, blocked or open escape routes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic fire simulation: water, smoke, heat, backdrafts, grease fires, and more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic fire trucks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic equipment and realistic tools</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/032cfce42bd9db91f87d59b4ff30af02.poster.avif?t=1784700641\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/032cfce42bd9db91f87d59b4ff30af02.webm?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/032cfce42bd9db91f87d59b4ff30af02.mp4?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Firefighters Code Red</strong>, the dev team draws on their experience from Firefighting Simulator – The Squad to send you to over 30 different locations across North America. Suit up and head exactly where everyone else is fleeing from: straight into the fire, through blazing buildings, thick smoke, and collapsing structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/60c1e9ca6a27d140fcc06efbb70a5a72.poster.avif?t=1784700641\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/60c1e9ca6a27d140fcc06efbb70a5a72.webm?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/60c1e9ca6a27d140fcc06efbb70a5a72.mp4?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/fb306dba928832a1367fe123bd5129ad.poster.avif?t=1784700641\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/fb306dba928832a1367fe123bd5129ad.webm?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extras/fb306dba928832a1367fe123bd5129ad.mp4?t=1784700641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game simulates fire with the same intensity it has in real life: it eats through rooms, spreads dynamically, and strikes back. Backdrafts detonate in an instant, grease fires punish the wrong extinguishing agent without mercy, and smoke thickens into a life-threatening zone of zero visibility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's electronics, chemicals, or uncontrolled chain reactions - every fire plays by its own rules. In Firefighters Code Red, fire spreads unpredictably, burns more fiercely both indoors and outdoors, and leaves visible destruction behind. And the danger doesn't stop at your front door: flames can spread to smaller wooded areas too, throwing new challenges your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533390/extr